","id":3057710707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62QPZz","user":{"login":"AeioMuch","id":75151379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTUxMzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75151379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T14:34:18Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T14:36:48Z","body":"> Isn't there a cheaper way to achieve this? In the end it comes down to `scroll_to_item()` call. Maybe you could add a helper method that scrolls to selected item if the tree is focused.\r\n\r\nIt was possible to move nodes with the keys even if the tree wasn't focused. So I prevented that directly... Hopefully it is desirable and would not considered a regression ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057710707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057766340","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108436#issuecomment-3057766340","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108436","id":3057766340,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62Qc_E","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T14:43:55Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T14:43:55Z","body":"Ok I should've clarified more.\r\nThe Tree should not scroll to moved it when you undo/redo, especially not when it's not focused. The easiest way to achieve this is to scroll to the item after undo/redo action is performed (committed), i.e. it shouldn't be part of the action. Note that this means that undoing moving item will not scroll even if you have the tree focused, but I think it's not worth fixing.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3057766340/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3058851155","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108436#issuecomment-3058851155","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108436","id":3058851155,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62Ul1T","user":{"login":"AeioMuch","id":75151379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTUxMzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75151379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-10T19:58:11Z","updated_at":"2025-07-10T20:09:52Z","body":"> Ok I should've clarified more. The Tree should not scroll to moved it when you undo/redo, especially not when it's not focused. The easiest way to achieve this is to scroll to the item after undo/redo action is performed (committed), i.e. it shouldn't be part of the action. Note that this means that undoing moving item will not scroll even if you have the tree focused, but I think it's not worth fixing.\r\n\r\nOk, now I think the behaviour is the same as before when using `_update_tree()` but cheaper and minus the UndoRedo. But I'm not sure if you want me to prevent the possibility to move the nodes with the keys if the tree is not focused. It's possible right now, probably because nobody complained. I think it would be better to allow it only if the tree is focused, but I noticed that the viewport is picking the focus by just hovering it with the mouse, so it could be annoying also. So not too sure what to do...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3058851155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3070043056","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108436#issuecomment-3070043056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108436","id":3070043056,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62_SOw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-14T15:35:24Z","updated_at":"2025-07-14T15:35:24Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3070043056/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]